#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:5
#: dbda107a23944a5c830dbd82c69d110a
msgid "Precision AutoLanding"
msgstr "精准自动降落"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:7
#: 2169cdf36f804b1b8940e337b6eb6c06
msgid ""
"In the case where the landing touch down point must be tightly controlled "
"(ie narrow and/or short landing area), the precision of the flare height and"
" approach speed (and therefore flare duration) must greater. This requires "
"either an accurate GPS (ie, :ref:`common-rtk-correction`), or ground facing "
"rangefinder or LIDAR, to obtain more precise altitude readings than a "
"barometer usually can provide due to impacts of air pressure changes in the "
"fuselage due to speed and angle of attack. Using an airspeed sensor is also "
"recommended to control approach speeds. All the same basic considerations, "
"previously discussed in the Basic Autolanding section also apply."
msgstr ""
"在必须严格控制降落触地点的情况下（即狭窄和/或短小的降落区域），拉平高度和进近空速（因而拉平持续时间）的精度必须更高。这需要精确的 GPS（即 "
":ref:`common-rtk-"
"correction`）或朝地测距仪或激光雷达，以获得比气压计通常能提供的更精确的高度读数，因为气压计会因机身内部速度和迎角引起的气压变化而受到影响。还建议使用空速传感器来控制进近空速。在基本自动降落部分中讨论的所有相同基本注意事项也适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:10
#: ec4293eb4b9a4b97b48cc6ded0edaec3
msgid ""
"this feature applies only to fixed wind landings. Copter style precision "
"vertical landings using IRLOCK and rangefinder is possible using a LUA "
"script for QuadPlanes, see `Precision Landing LUA applet "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/plane_precland.lua>`__."
msgstr ""
"此功能仅适用于固定翼降落。使用 IRLOCK 和测距仪进行多旋翼式精准垂直降落，QuadPlane 可以通过 LUA 脚本实现，参见 `精准降落 LUA"
" 应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/plane_precland.lua>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:13
#: 95cb02f247f64577b159cf78eda7f957
msgid "Precision Altitude Source"
msgstr "精准高度源"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:15
#: 8e131b1f53c346a38acbe50093f64a38
msgid ""
"A normal GPS will only provide vertical accuracy to within a couple of "
"meters. However, if an RTK corrected GPS is used, tens of centimeter "
"accuracy is possible. However, this requires a base station or laptop "
"providing correction data. See :ref:`common-rtk-correction` for details."
msgstr ""
"普通 GPS 的垂直精度只能达到几米以内。但如果使用 RTK 修正的 GPS，可以达到数十厘米的精度。但这需要提供修正数据的基站或笔记本电脑。详情参见 "
":ref:`common-rtk-correction`。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:17
#: 3f47e7b265be4c8ea9bdcbe4459263a5
msgid "To use the GPS as the altitude source instead of BARO set:"
msgstr "要使用 GPS 而非 BARO 作为高度源，请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:19
#: ba1ed0bd2e1b4a8c87518b3d7e929853
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 3 to use GPS instead of barometer for "
"altitude"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 3 以使用 GPS 代替气压计作为高度参考"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:21
#: b2dca9fee4d24ce5ab3c317cb8a85c6f
msgid ""
"Or a downward facing Lidar/Rangefinder can be used. See :ref:`rangefinder-"
"autolanding` page."
msgstr "或者可以使用朝下的激光雷达/测距仪。参见 :ref:`rangefinder-autolanding` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:24
#: bc762d9bcb9c4a799d3d9f29cb60e358
msgid "Approach Airspeed"
msgstr "进近空速"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:26
#: ccf6fc8ec53d4573a3ad32c242b39b3b
msgid ""
"Automatic landing is greatly assisted by the use of an airspeed sensor. When"
" using an airspeed sensor the landing approach speed (the speed coming down "
"the glide slope) is controlled by the :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD "
"<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` parameter, in meters/second."
msgstr ""
"自动降落通过使用空速传感器大幅改善。使用空速传感器时，降落进近速度（沿下滑道的速度）由 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD "
"<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` 参数控制，单位为米/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:32
#: f5461584e4614d429573f721a818eee5
msgid ""
"You need to choose a value for :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` that"
" is above the stall speed of your aircraft, but low enough that the aircraft"
" is able to lose altitude and land in a reasonable distance. Note that as "
"the stall speed is dependent on the weight of your aircraft you will need to"
" adjust the landing speed if you change the aircraft's weight significantly "
"(such as by adding batteries or a camera)."
msgstr ""
"需要为 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` "
"选择一个高于飞机失速速度但足够低的值，使飞机能够下降并在合理距离内降落。注意，由于失速速度取决于飞机重量，如果飞机重量发生显著变化（例如添加电池或摄像头），需要调整降落速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:39
#: 2912e326267c41fd8bb9c444d5f08b35
msgid ""
"The :ref:`LAND_WIND_COMP<LAND_WIND_COMP>` parameter controls how much "
"headwind compensation is used when landing. Headwind speed component "
"multiplied by this parameter is added to "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` value. Set to 0 to disable this."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LAND_WIND_COMP<LAND_WIND_COMP>` 参数控制降落时使用多少顺风补偿。顶风速度分量乘以此参数后加到 "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` 值上。设为 0 可禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:41
#: 86457ff5240b49cebb21c1e95b69ad37
msgid ""
"The target landing airspeed value is still limited to being lower than "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`."
msgstr "目标降落空速值仍受限于低于 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:43
#: f8f192853c194cc68d8ba3d9edc1d423
msgid ""
"To further improve landing you can use a Pre-Flare to reduce airspeed just "
"before the flare. This is enabled by setting either :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT "
"<LAND_PF_ALT>` or :ref:`LAND_PF_SEC <LAND_PF_SEC>` to either enter a pre-"
"flare state at a fixed altitude or at an estimated seconds to ground (given "
"your current decent rate). Once the Pre-Flare is triggered the desired "
"airspeed becomes :ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD <LAND_PF_ARSPD>`. This value should be "
"lower than :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` but greater than the "
"stall speed. This is particularly useful where reverse thrust is available. "
"However, some aircraft can handle a stall landing so setting this to a very "
"low number (1) will tell the aircraft to bleed off as much airspeed as "
"possible before the flare."
msgstr ""
"为进一步改善降落，可以在拉平前使用预拉平来降低空速。通过设置 :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT <LAND_PF_ALT>` 或 "
":ref:`LAND_PF_SEC <LAND_PF_SEC>` "
"在固定高度或估计到地面的秒数（根据当前下降速率）进入预拉平状态来启用。触发预拉平后，期望空速变为 :ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD "
"<LAND_PF_ARSPD>`。此值应低于 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` "
"但大于失速速度。在有反推力的情况下特别有用。但部分飞机可以处理失速降落，因此将此值设为非常低的数字（1）将告诉飞机在拉平前尽可能消耗空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:56
#: 7ef85513c34c48369d150e7195dd358a
msgid "Controlling the approach"
msgstr "控制进近"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:58
#: 71db36e3b40c490b8c6e41ae880ef4a5
msgid ""
"During the landing approach the autopilot needs to balance the requested "
"airspeed (set by :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>`) and the requested"
" glide slope and landing position (set by the final approach waypoint and "
"final landing point). The default configuration tries to balance these two "
"demands equally, but for some aircraft you may want to prioritize one over "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"降落进近期间，飞控需要平衡所请求的空速（由 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` "
"设置）和所请求的下滑坡度及降落位置（由最终进近航点和最终降落点设置）。默认配置尝试平衡这两个需求，但对某些飞机，您可能需要优先考虑其中一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:64
#: 9fb37bf87a5346d9b69ad0730ea06c39
msgid ""
"The priority of airspeed control versus height control is set using the "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT <TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` parameter. A value of 1 (the "
"default) means a balance between the two. A value closer to two gives a "
"higher priority to airspeed and a value closer to zero gives a higher "
"priority to height control. For example, if you are landing at a speed close"
" to the stall speed you may wish to place a high priority on the airspeed "
"control. To do that you should set :ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT "
"<TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` to a value close to 2, such as 1.9."
msgstr ""
"空速控制与高度控制的优先级使用 :ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT <TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` 参数设置。值为 "
"1（默认）表示两者之间的平衡。接近 2 的值给予空速更高优先级，接近 0 "
"的值给予高度控制更高优先级。例如，如果在接近失速速度的速度下降落，您可能希望给予空速控制高优先级。为此，应将 "
":ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT <TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` 设为接近 2 的值，例如 1.9。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:73
#: 398b9a53a1ec4477be0ad9253d6962c3
msgid ""
"If what you want in a landing is precision in the position where it lands "
"then you should set :ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT <TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` to a low "
"number, such as 0.2 or even 0.0. In that case the plane will still try to "
"achieve the target landing airspeed by using the throttle, but it will not "
"try to control airspeed with pitch."
msgstr ""
"如果您在降落中追求的是降落位置的精度，应将 :ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT <TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` 设为较低值，例如 "
"0.2 甚至 0.0。在这种情况下，飞机仍会尝试通过油门达到目标降落空速，但不会尝试用俯仰控制空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:79
#: 0add8cf4acf1498b96a4fd3a88f3df64
msgid ""
"If you are landing a glider (or any aircraft without a motor) then you "
"should set :ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT <TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` to 2.0, so that "
"airspeed is the priority and pitch will be used to control airspeed."
msgstr ""
"如果您在降落一架滑翔机（或任何没有电机的飞机），应将 :ref:`TECS_LAND_SPDWGT <TECS_LAND_SPDWGT>` 设为 "
"2.0，使空速成为优先级，俯仰将用于控制空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:83
#: 6bdc955b6d104f0e8c63c8c384c9197c
msgid ""
"In most cases a value of -1 gives the best result. This special value will "
"auto-adjust the value during the landing, scaling it from your normal "
":ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT <TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` value down to zero at the point of "
"landing. So up in the sky during approach you maintain good airspeed but by "
"the time you land the emphasis is on a more accurate landing."
msgstr ""
"在大多数情况下，值为 -1 能给出最佳结果。此特殊值将在降落过程中自动调整该值，从您正常的 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT "
"<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 值逐渐降低到降落时的零。因此在空中进近时您保持良好的空速，但到降落时重点是更精确的降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:91
#: 16abd92c908f4d86960077dfa937a05a
msgid "Determining your max glide slope angle"
msgstr "确定最大下滑坡度角"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:93
#: adf3b63c2c604128ae657bc3bfe21d16
msgid ""
"For a steep landing approach, the limitation is how well you can maintain "
"your desired airspeed. This is determined by your aircraft's ability to "
"create reverse thrust (motor+prop thrust or airbrake drag ability),if used,"
"  and its resistance to slowing down (aircraft mass). In many cases extreme "
"steepness is unnecessary, but possible. With an over-sized motor and "
"lightweight aircraft you can come in as steep as 60 degrees."
msgstr ""
"对于陡峭的降落进近，限制因素是维持所需空速的能力。这取决于飞机产生反推力的能力（电机+螺旋桨推力或空气制动阻力，如使用）及其减速的阻力（飞机质量）。在许多情况下极度陡峭是不必要的，但是可以实现的。使用超大电机和轻型飞机，可以以高达"
" 60 度的角度进近。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:98
#: 6cb20f99ed084ba8a975b7d274d99033
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To determine your steepest approach angle, set :ref:`TECS_APPR_SMAX "
"<TECS_APPR_SMAX>` very high as to not limit you (e.g. 99). Next, plan a "
"mission with a steeper than normal approach (try 15 degrees and go up from "
"there). Watch your airspeed on the approach - the aircraft should be able to"
" maintain :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` without exceeding 75% of "
"the available reverse throttle range. If not, you're coming in too steep for"
" the negative-thrust-to-mass ratio of your aircraft."
msgstr ""
"要确定最陡进近角，将 :ref:`TECS_APPR_SMAX <TECS_APPR_SMAX>` 设为非常高的值以不受限制（例如 "
"99）。然后规划一个比正常进近更陡的任务（从 15 度开始逐渐增加）。观察进近时的空速——飞机应能维持 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD "
"<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` 而不超过可用反推油门范围的 75%。如果超过，说明对于飞机的负推力质量比来说进近角过陡。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:105
#: 1f9e456efb0d41d183648a9bb7d38716
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that whatever value you determine as your maximum may not be "
"acceptable in all wind conditions. It is best to be a little conservative to"
" maintain repeatability."
msgstr "请记住，您确定的最大值在所有风况下可能都不可接受。最好保守一些以保持可重复性。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:110
#: e0c9dbec1fa34975b4f09e9ed70cab5f
msgid ":ref:`automatic-flaps` can also be used for steeper approaches."
msgstr ":ref:`automatic-flaps` 也可用于更陡的进近。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:113
#: 6ceb0abeb8ab4ac78e50b65b6930a6c4
msgid "Setting up a Pre-Flare"
msgstr "设置预拉平"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:115
#: 7c13fc2b18f840d1aa4410c2c8587ac5
msgid ""
"With a rangefinder or accurate GPS, and airspeed sensors installed, a pre-"
"flare point can be set since we will have an accurate airspeed and altitude "
"reading."
msgstr "安装测距仪或精确 GPS 以及空速传感器后，可以设置预拉平点，因为我们将有精确的空速和高度读数。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:117
#: 974752e7b3f944c9b2998a02ef1cd4ab
msgid ""
"This gives us a good idea of our momentum and stable \"initial conditions\" "
"to the final flare. Set :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` (and/or "
":ref:`LAND_PF_SEC<LAND_PF_SEC>`) to a fairly high point (for example 10m) "
"and adjust from there. Next set :ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>` to a "
"value just above your stall speed."
msgstr ""
"这为我们提供了关于飞机动量和稳定「初始条件」到最终拉平的良好信息。将 :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>`（和/或 "
":ref:`LAND_PF_SEC<LAND_PF_SEC>`）设为较高的点（例如 10m）并从那里调整。然后将 "
":ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>` 设为略高于失速速度的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:119
#: ecad3733ccbd4530a86c7d0fecfcb5ee
msgid ""
"When :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` is reached the airspeed demand will "
"instantly go from :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` to "
":ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>`."
msgstr ""
"达到 :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` 时，空速需求将从 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD "
"<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` 立即变为 :ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:121
#: f7a201c68f1e48018542a4d9bf3f18e8
msgid ""
"This will cause it to slam on the brakes if reverse thrust is being used "
"(see :ref:`reverse-thrust-autolanding`) so that the airspeed reduces to the "
"desired airspeed quickly, otherwise plan for some time/distance for the "
"airspeed to reduce."
msgstr ""
"如果使用反推力（参见 :ref:`reverse-thrust-"
"autolanding`），这将导致快速制动，使空速迅速降低到所需空速，否则需要一些时间/距离来降低空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:123
#: 595078bccd334d069cc282e99bd482d3
msgid ""
"The trick is to set :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` to an altitude where it "
"achieves :ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>` before killing the throttle at "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` (which is set at a lower altitude - "
"around 1 or 2m)."
msgstr ""
"诀窍在于将 :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` 设置到一个高度，使飞机在 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>`（设置在较低高度——约 1 或 2m）关闭油门之前能达到 "
":ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:128
#: 7d976913cfb6488fad8dfdbf6ac75197
msgid ""
"Example, :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` = 15, "
":ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>` = 12, :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` = "
"12, :ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` = 2. Depending on your slope, mass"
" of aircraft and motor+propeller thrust ability, you're expecting the "
"aircraft to decelerate from 15m/s to 12m/s airspeed while dropping 10m to "
"2m. These are the critical params to adjust to ensure a smooth and slow "
"flare below 2m altitude."
msgstr ""
"示例：:ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD <TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` = "
"15，:ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>` = 12，:ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` "
"= 12，:ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` = 2。根据您的坡度、飞机质量和电机+螺旋桨推力能力，预期飞机在从"
" 12m 下降到 2m 的过程中将空速从 15m/s 减速到 12m/s。这些是关键参数，需要调整以确保在 2m 高度以下平稳缓慢地拉平。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:131
#: 12adb836d02247db9e9d5dfa5c1c7010
msgid "Flare"
msgstr "拉平"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:133
#: f6aabd27ed7940eeb3d886acd54cf16e
msgid ""
"Now that you are starting the flare with a stable and predictable airspeed, "
"it's much easier to :ref:`control the flare <automatic-"
"landing_controlling_the_flare>`. If you've already tuned your flare for an "
"auto-land without reverse thrust you'll want to retune it. You'll notice "
"you're coming in much slower ad tuning will be easier. The tweaks and "
"compromises you had to do before are much easier to deal with."
msgstr ""
"现在您以稳定且可预测的空速开始拉平，:ref:`控制拉平 <automatic-landing_controlling_the_flare>` "
"变得容易得多。如果您已经针对无反推力的自动降落调好了拉平，需要重新调参。您会注意到进近速度更慢，调参也更容易。之前必须做的调整和权衡现在更容易处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:140
#: 9b34dba24a7049e0ae0c0d089cc29c0d
msgid "Determining actual stall speed of your aircraft"
msgstr "确定飞机实际失速速度"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:142
#: 3c7c7e2fee24453aadfe9b9574427bc9
msgid ""
"Unless you really know what you're doing, stall speed can be hard to "
"estimate. Traditionally, to determine this true value you would need to "
"slowly decrease your airspeed until you stall but that comes with the pesky "
"problem that now you have a stalled aircraft falling out of the sky."
msgstr ""
"除非您真的知道自己在做什么，否则失速速度很难估计。传统上，要确定此真实值，需要缓慢降低空速直到失速，但这带来了飞机失速后从空中坠落的棘手问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-autolanding.rst:145
#: 3588e3beb176423286c2421842464e3a
msgid ""
"With :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` and :ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>`"
" you can check your stall speed much lower to the ground. To know the "
"airspeed at the exact moment it stalls, check your dataflash logs (``*.bin``"
" on SD card) for the airspeed (ARSP.Airspeed) when your wing loses lift and "
"drops by comparing actual roll (CTUN.Roll) and desired roll (CTUN.NavPitch) "
"diverge."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`LAND_PF_ALT<LAND_PF_ALT>` 和 "
":ref:`LAND_PF_ARSPD<LAND_PF_ARSPD>`，可以在更低的高度检查失速速度。要知道飞机失速时的精确空速，可检查数据闪存日志（SD"
" 卡上的 ``*.bin`` "
"文件）中的空速（ARSP.Airspeed），通过比较实际横滚（CTUN.Roll）和期望横滚（CTUN.NavPitch）发散时来判断机翼何时失去升力。"
